Added a `kind` specifier to the import groups of the [`organizeImports`](https://biomejs.dev/assist/actions/organize-imports/) assist action.

Use `{ "kind": "bare" }` to match side-effect only imports (such as `import "polyfill"`) and `{ "kind": "!bare" }` to match imports that have at least one binding. It can be combined with a `source` glob, e.g. `{ "kind": "bare", "source": "**/*.css" }` matches only bare imports from CSS files.

